                                        "entry_id": "c3739e0e-8d15-39fb-94c6-febea3ce1034",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A dove or pigeon, now specifically of the species Columba palumbus."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "UK"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0b1ac19e-2b1f-4881-8b5b-74fc6d8b73e7",
                                                "sense_id": "a1ea2cfb-1ac6-31a5-9ef0-8e2a2367e3cb",
                                                "text": "Had he ſo doen, he had him ſnatcht away, / More light then Culuer in the Faulcons fiſt."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5d9f13d2-73c6-49f6-8e1c-3853fb3355ed",
                                                "sense_id": "a1ea2cfb-1ac6-31a5-9ef0-8e2a2367e3cb",
                                                "text": "The palsie plagues my pulses\nwhen I prigg yoͬ: piggs or pullen\nyour culuers take, or matchles make\nyour Chanticleare or sullen"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "dc7bef5d-0a5e-4a06-bfea-7437b6c6b977",
                                                "sense_id": "a1ea2cfb-1ac6-31a5-9ef0-8e2a2367e3cb",
                                                "text": "Then he walked on a little and came to a goodly cage, than which was no goodlier there, and in it a culver of the forest, that is to say, a wood-pigeon, the bird renowned among birds as the minstrel of love-longing, with a collar of jewels about its neck marvellous fine and fair."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
